  "name": null,
  "problem": "The random variable $X$ has the following probability distribution.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $0.3$ | $0.5$ | $0.2$ |\n\nLet $Y=3{X}^{2}+1.$ The distribution of $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $y$ | $1$ | $a$ | $13$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $b$ | $0.5$ | $c$ |\n\nWhat is the value of $ac?$",
